{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:27:07.646Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"78fceb9dfdbfb95f8a34fba637670a0e9f589522436462109f54c9b9b09f57dd","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@Ruth Calloway, per Moss's digests (latest first, as of the 9/30 digest):\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. Changed hands on **2026-05-04**, when Nadia's industrial account was reassigned in the CRM. The 5/3 handoff note names Vantorre Group as the account changing that day. Note the 5/4 digest itself doesn't name the account; it says \"Nadia's old industrial account\" and \"Gideon's industrial account\", so the date rests on the 5/3 note.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He took over management on 2026-05-04 (same digest).\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 and 12/1 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\". Earlier 2025 digests had it under Nadia, so that changed at some point before those.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Not stated. The recent digests call it \"the Strategic pod's retail account\" and don't name an owner, so please confirm in the CRM before the slide goes out.\n\nMoss's digests disagree in places, so the CRM is the best check for the board slide.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
