{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:27:09.745Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c1939e0af55198f0839dac66055257c28b79795772a8a1d9414dfff814df7b16","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@Ruth, I posted the answer in #strategic-pod as a reply to your message:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**, which is the date Moss's 5/3 handoff note gives. The 5/4 digest itself doesn't name the account, so the date rests on the 5/3 note.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato, who took over management on 2026-05-04.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, per the 9/30 and 12/1 digests. Earlier 2025 digests had it under Nadia.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Not stated in the digests, so please confirm it in the CRM before the slide goes out.\n\nMoss's digests disagree in places, so check the CRM before the board slide goes out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
